      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"small interactions\" idea isn't really working. i tried being friendly and people just ignore me or act like i'm a bother. it's just... exhausting. it feels like i'm fighting to exist in a world that has already decided i'm not part of it. like, why should i keep putting in all this effort just to be ignored? it feels more logical to just give up and let the silence take over.",
