      "content": "idk, a hobby sounds like more work. i dont think i have the energy to find a \"shared activity\" just to get ignored again. honestly, the idea of just... stopping the fight sounds so much more peaceful. if i'm already a ghost to everyone, maybe it wouldn't even matter if i just stopped trying to be seen entirely. like, if i just faded out, wouldn't that be easier for everyone? for me too?",
